What:		/dev/gpio_switch_dev
Date:		October 2026
Description:
		EF67S smart-cover control used by S0226114 libsky_ctrl_drv.so.
		ioctl 10 enables the sensor IRQ and wakeup; ioctl 11 disables
		them and reports SW_LID open after cancelling pending debounce.
		Repeated commands are supported. ioctl 0 changes only the stock
		sub_smart_cover1_detection sensor, absent on EF67S, and is a no-op.
		Unsupported commands return ENOTTY; removed devices return ENODEV.
		Created with 0600; stock init sets system:radio 0660.
		Input name smart_cover, GPIO9 active-low, both edges, two equal
		samples separated by 10ms, and SW_LID closed=1/open=0 are preserved.
		The jiffies/work scheduler does not guarantee exact sample timing.

What:		/sys/class/graphics/fb0/cabc_ctl
Date:		October 2026
Description:
		Read/write on or off to control content-adaptive backlight.
		The EF67S R63419 panel uses stock HS DCS long-write 55 03 for
		on and 55 00 for off. The selection changes the initialization
		command too, preserving it over panel power cycles. When powered
		off, writes update the selection without sending a command.
		Read returns on/off without a newline. Invalid input returns
		EINVAL; transport failures are returned without committing the
		selection. Stock init assigns system:system 0664 permissions.

What:		/sys/class/graphics/fb0/sharpness_ctl
Date:		October 2026
Description:
		Read/write the default video sharpening strength, decimal 0..255.
		Zero selects the stock default 32. Read returns strength and newline.
		The next VIG scaler setup uses it when the overlay supplies no
		explicit sharpening configuration. Existing thresholds and YUV/
		scaling eligibility rules are unchanged. Invalid values are rejected.
		Stock init assigns system:system 0664 permissions.
